            "review_title": "Review at Hanoi Seafood Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Nina E\n2 contributions\n1\nLovely experience\nMay 2019 • Friends\nWe thoroughly enjoyed our visit at the Street Food Cafe! \nThe host was very kind to our group of friends - he gave food suggestions & offered us peanuts & free rice wine (which he makes himself). \nWe sat ons the second floor with a street view. We had the Bun Cha & Fried Pancakes, which were both delicious.\nRead more\nWritten May 17, 2019",
